{% comment %}
  ============================================
  KITCHENFOUNDER — HOMEPAGE CUSTOM LIQUID (SHUFFLING GUIDE GRID)
  ============================================
  ⚠️ THIS FILE GOES ON THE HOME PAGE ONLY. Do not add it to any product or
  collection page — it already contains the hero video and the ember glow on
  the final CTA. Adding it anywhere else duplicates your whole homepage there.

  WHAT CHANGED vs the previous version:
  The "Most popular right now" grid used to be 6 hardcoded cards, so every
  visitor saw the same 6 guides forever. It now builds a pool from your live
  catalogue and shows a RANDOM 6 on every page load. Add a product to the
  store and it joins the pool automatically — no code edit needed.

  HOW TO USE:
  1. Shopify Admin → Online Store → Themes → Edit theme
  2. Top bar page-switcher must say "Home page" — if it says anything else,
     click the dropdown and select Home page first
  3. Click the existing "Custom Liquid" section, select everything in the
     code box and delete it
  4. Paste THIS ENTIRE FILE in its place
  5. Click Save (top right)

  EDITING THE CARD NUMBERS:
  The P&L / Margin / Startup figures live in the KF STATS TABLE below.
  One line per product:  handle::P&L::Margin::Startup::Short card title
  - handle = the last part of the product URL (/products/<handle>)
  - leave a field empty to hide that line on the card
  - a product with no line here still appears in the shuffle; it just shows
    "Full P&L model · Instant download" instead of the numbers
  ============================================
{% endcomment %}

